      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Most people don’t know that the best-selling car in the world is the Tesla Model Y. \n\nAnd the second and third best-selling cars are much cheaper.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "XFreeze",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1876785200010539008/2_HFJjq9_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-08 03:08:14",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-07T19:08:14.000Z",
        "id": "2119144915456417842",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWi28HNbAAA2DLp.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1592,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWi28HNbAAA2DLp.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 2542
          }
        ],
        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "Tesla Model Y has been the world’s best-selling passenger vehicle for 3 consecutive years\n\n2023 → #1  \n2024 → #1  \n2025 → #1\n\nModel Y alone has surpassed 4 million global sales, while Tesla has now delivered more than 10 million vehicles worldwide\n\nNot just the best-selling EV\n\nModel Y beat every gas, hybrid and electric passenger vehicle worldwide for three straight years\n\nAn electric car reaching this scale would have sounded impossible not long ago\n\nNow millions of Model Ys are on roads around the world",
        "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2119144915456417842",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 30,
        "likes": 1246,
        "quotes": 15,
        "replies": 305,
        "retweets": 157,
        "views": 346558
      },
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2119146526899396725",
      "images": [],
      "media": [],
      "enriched": true
    },
